# Dormant Powers Dislodged (jeuno 136), each entry of the wanted-item table: a level 86 Warrior at cap 90, accepted (a
# GM). For itemWanted 1 to 10 (a GM each time; index 0 to 9), with 10 merit points: a Kindred's Crest and that entry's
# item play 10191; each finish takes the pair, spends 10 merit points and sets Prog 1 (set back to 0, and the merit
# points to 10, by a GM). The entries: Pinch of Valkurm Sunsand, Faded Crystal, Orcish Plate Armor, Magicked Skull, Cup
# of Dhalmel Saliva, Yagudo Caulk, Siren's Tear, Dangruf Stone, Orcish Axe, Quadav Backscale. (itemWanted 0 or 11 and
# more index past the table: a Lua script error, not recorded.)
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrade RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10191
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=10.0,1.5,119.9 job=WAR lvl=86
levelcap 90
merits 10
quest Jeuno.DormantPowersDislodged accepted
item KindredsCrest x10
item PinchOfValkurmSunsand
item FadedCrystal
item OrcishPlateArmor
item MagickedSkull
item CupOfDhalmelSaliva
item YagudoCaulk
item SirensTear
item DangrufStone
item OrcishAxe
item QuadavBackscale
login
charvar Quest[3][136]itemWanted 1       # a GM: index 0
trade Nomad_Moogle KindredsCrest x1 PinchOfValkurmSunsand x1  # 10191
finish                                  # the pair taken, merits 0, Prog 1
charvar Quest[3][136]Prog 0             # a GM
merits 10                               # a GM
charvar Quest[3][136]itemWanted 2       # index 1
trade Nomad_Moogle KindredsCrest x1 FadedCrystal x1  # 10191
finish
charvar Quest[3][136]Prog 0
merits 10
charvar Quest[3][136]itemWanted 3       # index 2
trade Nomad_Moogle KindredsCrest x1 OrcishPlateArmor x1  # 10191
finish
charvar Quest[3][136]Prog 0
merits 10
charvar Quest[3][136]itemWanted 4       # index 3
trade Nomad_Moogle KindredsCrest x1 MagickedSkull x1  # 10191
finish
charvar Quest[3][136]Prog 0
merits 10
charvar Quest[3][136]itemWanted 5       # index 4
trade Nomad_Moogle KindredsCrest x1 CupOfDhalmelSaliva x1  # 10191
finish
charvar Quest[3][136]Prog 0
merits 10
charvar Quest[3][136]itemWanted 6       # index 5
trade Nomad_Moogle KindredsCrest x1 YagudoCaulk x1  # 10191
finish
charvar Quest[3][136]Prog 0
merits 10
charvar Quest[3][136]itemWanted 7       # index 6
trade Nomad_Moogle KindredsCrest x1 SirensTear x1  # 10191
